                                                     &lt;li&gt;=0A               =
                                                     &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run dialo=
gue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                     =
           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                         =
           &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinters=
.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                              =
      &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                              =
  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;=
li&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;=
p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                  =
                              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                     =
