                           &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers folder will op=
en.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;=
/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=
=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;N=
ext, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A                   =
