                                       &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printer to the =
wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                          =
          &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=0A      =
